"H3068\"in|strong=\"H3068\"the|strong=\"H3068\"time|strong=\"H6256\"of|strong=\"H3068\"affliction|strong=\"H6869\".   \n"},{"number":12,"text":"Can one break|strong=\"H7489\"iron|strong=\"H1270\",  \neven iron|strong=\"H1270\"from the|strong=\"H7489\"north|strong=\"H6828\", and|strong=\"H5178\"bronze|strong=\"H5178\"?   \n"},{"number":13,"text":"I|strong=\"H5414\"will|strong=\"H5414\"give|strong=\"H5414\"your|strong=\"H3605\"substance|strong=\"H2428\"and|strong=\"H2403\"your|strong=\"H3605\"treasures for|strong=\"H3605\"a|strong=\"H3068\"plunder without|strong=\"H3808\"price|strong=\"H4242\",  \nand|strong=\"H2403\"that|strong=\"H3605\"for|strong=\"H3605\"all|strong=\"H3605\"your|strong=\"H3605\"sins|strong=\"H2403\",  \neven|strong=\"H3808\"in|strong=\"H5414\"all|strong=\"H3605\"your|strong=\"H3605\"borders|strong=\"H1366\".   \n"},{"number":14,"text":"I|strong=\"H3588\"will|strong=\"H3808\"make|strong=\"H3045\"them|strong=\"H5921\"to|strong=\"H5921\"pass|strong=\"H5674\"with|strong=\"H5921\"your|strong=\"H5921\"enemies into|strong=\"H5921\"a|strong=\"H3068\"land which|strong=\"H3588\"you|strong=\"H3588\"don’t know|strong=\"H3045\";  \nfor|strong=\"H3588\"a|strong=\"H3068\"fire is|strong=\"H3808\"kindled|strong=\"H6919\"in|strong=\"H5921\"my|strong=\"H5921\"anger|strong=\"H5674\",  \nwhich|strong=\"H3588\"will|strong=\"H3808\"burn|strong=\"H3344\"on|strong=\"H5921\"you|strong=\"H3588\".”   \n"},{"number":15,"text":"LORD|strong=\"H3068\", you|strong=\"H5921\"know|strong=\"H3045\".  \nRemember|strong=\"H2142\"me|strong=\"H5921\", visit|strong=\"H6485\"me|strong=\"H5921\",  \nand|strong=\"H3068\"avenge|strong=\"H5358\"me|strong=\"H5921\"of|strong=\"H3068\"my|strong=\"H3068\"persecutors|strong=\"H7291\".  \nYou|strong=\"H5921\"are|strong=\"H3068\"patient, so|strong=\"H3947\"don’t take|strong=\"H3947\"me|strong=\"H5921\"away|strong=\"H3947\".  \nKnow|strong=\"H3045\"that|strong=\"H3045\"for|strong=\"H5921\"your|strong=\"H3068\"sake|strong=\"H5921\"I|strong=\"H5921\"have